"A Caravan will be hired when you Click on the Hire Caravan Tile. It will "
"stand outside on the South side of the Market. "
msgstr ""
"Es contractarà una caravana quan facis clic a la casella de Contractar "
"caravana. Apareixerà a fora, al costat sud del mercat. "

