msgid ""
"A Mine can hold eight Miners. If there are any jobs left in the Mine, "
"Peasants from your Village will now start going to work there. "
msgstr ""
"Una mina pot acollir vuit miners. Si encara hi queden llocs de treball, els "
"pagesos del teu poble començaran a anar-hi a treballar. "

msgid "A Pfith Lair has been destroyed."
msgstr "S'ha destruït un Cau de Pfith."

msgid ""
"A Porcupine %s of yours has broken down due to the lack of maintenance funds."
msgstr "Un Porc espí %s teu s'ha avariat per manca de fons de manteniment."

msgid ""
"A Porcupine is a Weapon designed to be destroyed by your own forces. Send "
"one or -- better yet -- several Porcupines into the midst of the enemy. "
msgstr ""
"Un Porc espí és una arma dissenyada per ser destruïda per les teves pròpies "
"forces. Envia'n un, o encara millor, diversos, al mig de l'enemic. "

msgid "A Question of Succession"
msgstr "Una qüestió de successió"

msgid "A Rattus Lair has been destroyed."
msgstr "S'ha destruït un Cau de Rattus."

