msgid ""
"A Spitfire %s of yours has broken down due to the lack of maintenance funds."
msgstr "Un Llançaflames %s teu s'ha avariat per manca de fons de manteniment."

msgid ""
"A Spy in a Fort or a Seat of Power will be able to attempt an assassination "
"on the enemy commander, be he General or King. To do this, Click on the "
"building and then on the Assassinate Button. You do not need to select the "
"enemy target as the commander is the only possible one. "
msgstr ""
"Un espia en un fort o en un Tron de Poder podrà intentar assassinar el "
"comandant enemic, sigui general o rei. Per fer-ho, fes clic a l'edifici i "
"després al botó d'Assassinar. No cal que seleccionis l'objectiu enemic, ja "
"que el comandant és l'únic possible. "

msgid "A Trader of yours has broken down due to the lack of maintenance funds."
msgstr "Un Comerciant teu s'ha avariat per manca de fons de manteniment."

msgid ""
"A Transport of yours has broken down due to the lack of maintenance funds."
msgstr "Un Transport teu s'ha avariat per manca de fons de manteniment."

msgid ""
"A Unicorn %s of yours has broken down due to the lack of maintenance funds."
msgstr "Un Unicorn %s teu s'ha avariat per manca de fons de manteniment."

msgid ""
"A War Factory is built in the same manner as a Factory, and is staffed with "
"the same kind of skilled Manufacturers. "
msgstr ""
"Una fàbrica de guerra es construeix de la mateixa manera que una fàbrica i "
"és atesa pel mateix tipus de fabricants qualificats. "

msgid "A Warlike People"
msgstr "Un poble bel·licós"

msgid "A Weakened State"
msgstr "Un estat afeblit"

msgid "A Wyrm Lair has been destroyed."
msgstr "S'ha destruït un Cau de Wyrm."

msgid ""
"A more systematic way of collecting taxes from your people is to Right-Click "
"on the Tax Tile. This will bring up a selection of buttons. Clicking on one "
"of them will collect tax from that Village whenever its Loyalty Level "
"reaches the number on the button. "
msgstr ""
"Una manera més sistemàtica de recaptar impostos del teu poble és fer clic "
"dret a la casella d'Impost. Això mostrarà una selecció de botons. En fer "
"clic en un d'ells, es recaptaran impostos d'aquell poble sempre que el seu "
"nivell de lleialtat arribi al número del botó. "

msgid "A new Kingdom has emerged under the leadership of %s."
msgstr "Un nou Regne ha sorgit sota el lideratge de %s."

msgid ""
"A quick -- although sometimes expensive -- way of building a multi-cultural "
"Kingdom of highly skilled people is to hire Mercenaries. "
msgstr ""
"Una manera ràpida, tot i que de vegades cara, de construir un regne "
"multicultural amb gent molt hàbil és contractar mercenaris. "

msgid ""
"A simpler way to get money is to tax your people. There are several ways of "
"doing so: "
msgstr ""
"Una manera més senzilla d'obtenir diners és cobrar impostos al teu poble. Hi "
"ha diverses maneres de fer-ho: "

msgid ""
