msgid ""
"A spy from %s's Kingdom%s has been uncovered and executed in your village of "
"%s."
msgstr ""
"Un espia del Regne de %s%s ha estat descobert i executat al teu poble de %s."

msgid ""
"Above the color choices you will see the Sneak Tile. This Tile means that "
"when you change the color of your Spy's cloak, it will be done secretly. "
msgstr ""
"Damunt de les opcions de color veuràs la casella d'Infiltrar-se. Aquesta "
"casella vol dir que, quan canviïs el color de la capa de l'espia, es farà en "
"secret. "

