msgid ""
"Across the landscape you will come across a number of Fryhtans' Lairs; these "
"harbor a great variety of dangerous beings. The Lairs will appear on your "
"world map as white dots, slightly smaller than those denoting Independent "
"Villages. "
msgstr ""
"Pel paisatge trobaràs diversos caus de Fryhtans; aquests llocs amaguen una "
"gran varietat d'éssers perillosos. Els caus apareixeran al mapa del món com "
"a punts blancs, una mica més petits que els que indiquen pobles "
"independents. "

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Acció"

msgid ""
"After a Miner has been trained, select him and then Click on the Build Tile. "
msgstr ""
"Quan s'hagi entrenat un miner, selecciona'l i fes clic a la casella de "
"Construir. "

msgid ""
"After any Ship has been built, it will remain in the safety of the Harbor. "
"You'll see the Ship listed in the Harbor's registry. A maximum of four ships "
"may be in the Harbor at any one time. "
msgstr ""
"Quan s'hagi construït un vaixell, romandrà segur dins del port. El veuràs "
"llistat al registre del port. Hi pot haver un màxim de quatre vaixells al "
"port alhora. "

msgid ""
"After you press this button, click your cursor on the harbor where you want "
"your trade ship to stop. "
msgstr ""
"Després de prémer aquest botó, fes clic amb el cursor al port on vols que "
"s'aturi el vaixell comercial. "

msgid ""
"After you press this button, click your cursor on the location where you "
"want your caravan to stop. "
msgstr ""
"Després de prémer aquest botó, fes clic amb el cursor a la ubicació on vols "
"que s'aturi la caravana. "

msgid ""
"After your Factory has been built, the Manufacturer who built it will go to "
"work there, and Peasants from the Village will begin to volunteer. "
msgstr ""
"Quan la fàbrica estigui construïda, el fabricant que l'ha construïda hi "
"anirà a treballar i els pagesos del poble començaran a oferir-se voluntaris. "

msgid ""
"After your Manufacturer has been trained, select him and then Click on the "
"Build Tile. "
msgstr ""
"Quan el fabricant hagi estat entrenat, selecciona'l i fes clic a la casella "
"de Construir. "

msgid "Aggressive Mode Enabled. Click for Passive Mode."
msgstr "Mode agressiu activat. Fes clic per al mode passiu."

