msgstr "L'Altíssim Wyrm ha estat abatut."

msgid "An Ick Lair has been destroyed."
msgstr "S'ha destruït un Cau de Ick."

msgid "An Insular Possession"
msgstr "Una possessió insular"

msgid ""
"An aggressive Zulu Kingdom has been established between the two Great Lakes, "
"blocking your route to the Northern Wastes. You have seven years in which to "
"\"persuade\" this Kingdom that it would be much better off not existing. "
msgstr ""
"Un regne zulu agressiu s'ha establert entre els dos Grans Llacs i bloqueja "
"la teva ruta cap als Ermots del Nord. Tens set anys per \"persuadir\" aquest "
"regne que li aniria molt millor no existir. "

msgid ""
"An enemy spy has been killed while attempting to assassinate your General."
msgstr ""
"Un espia enemic ha estat eliminat mentre intentava assassinar el teu general."

msgid "An enemy spy has been killed while attempting to assassinate your King."
msgstr ""
"Un espia enemic ha estat eliminat mentre intentava assassinar el teu rei."

msgid "An error occurred creating the back surface!"
msgstr "S'ha produït un error en crear la superfície posterior!"

msgid "An error occurred creating the front surface!"
msgstr "S'ha produït un error en crear la superfície frontal!"

msgid "And Executed."
msgstr "I executat."

msgid ""
"Another thing you can do is to close the Link between the Village and the "
"Factory, by Clicking on the rotating Green & Yellow ring. If close the Link "
"it will change into a green cross. This will prevent any Peasants from "
"volunteering for work in the Factory. "
msgstr ""
"Una altra cosa que pots fer és tancar l'enllaç entre el poble i la fàbrica "
"fent clic a l'anell verd i groc giratori. Si tanques l'enllaç, es convertirà "
"en una creu verda. Això impedirà que cap pagès s'ofereixi voluntari per "
"treballar a la fàbrica. "

msgid ""
"Another thing you may do to raise your reputation more quickly is to attack "
"Fryhtan Lairs.  Everybody respects the extermination of these creatures. "
msgstr ""
"Una altra cosa que pots fer per augmentar la reputació més ràpidament és "
"atacar caus Fryhtan. Tothom respecta l'extermini d'aquestes criatures. "

msgid "Any"
msgstr "Qualsevol"

msgid ""
"Any Harbor used as a terminus in a trading route must be Linked to either "
"Markets, Mines or Factories. If a link is not made, your Trading Ships will "
"have nothing to carry, as Harbors keep no goods in storage. They are simply "
"a link between resource places and your Ships. "
msgstr ""
"Qualsevol port utilitzat com a terminal d'una ruta comercial ha d'estar "
"enllaçat amb mercats, mines o fàbriques. Si no s'hi fa cap enllaç, els "
"vaixells mercants no tindran res per transportar, ja que els ports no "
"emmagatzemen béns. Són simplement un enllaç entre els llocs de recursos i "
"els teus vaixells. "

msgid ""
"As you can see, the common soldier's Sword Icon has changed into a General's "
"Star. Now send him into the Fort, so that he can begin to exert his control "
"over the new Village. "
msgstr ""
"Com pots veure, la icona d'espasa del soldat ras s'ha convertit en "
"l'estrella d'un general. Ara envia'l al fort perquè pugui començar a exercir "
"control sobre el nou poble. "

msgid ""
"As you can see, the entire Troop has been selected again. This is the "
"fastest method of selection; it's especially useful in the heat of battle. "
msgstr ""
"Com pots veure, tota la tropa s'ha tornat a seleccionar. Aquest és el mètode "
"de selecció més ràpid; és especialment útil en plena batalla. "

msgid "Assassinate"
msgstr "Assassinar"

msgid "Assassination Failed."
msgstr "Assassinat fallit."

msgid "Assassination Succeeded."
msgstr "Assassinat exitós."

msgid "At Ease"
msgstr "En repòs"

msgid ""
"At the beginning of the game you will have only one Village, so domestic "
"trade will not yet be possible. That leaves Trade with foreign Kingdoms. "
msgstr ""
"Al començament de la partida només tindràs un poble, així que el comerç "
"intern encara no serà possible. Això deixa el comerç amb regnes estrangers. "

msgid ""
"At the end of a long and destructive war, you and your rival are severely "
"weakened. Pull back, regroup and prepare your forces to finish your mission; "
"the liberation of all of the world's peoples from their oppressors. When you "
"stand, the world shall truly be free and you will be the victor. "
msgstr ""
"Al final d'una guerra llarga i destructiva, tant tu com el teu rival esteu "
"greument afeblits. Retira't, reagrupa't i prepara les forces per acabar la "
"missió: l'alliberament de tots els pobles del món dels seus opressors. Quan "
"quedis dempeus, el món serà veritablement lliure i tu seràs el vencedor. "

msgid ""
"At the end of the \"The War to End all Wars for a While\", a band of "
"unemployed mercenaries roams the ravaged countryside. Take control of this "
"band, elect a King from among them and try to re-establish the destroyed "
"Kingdom for which they once fought. You must survive the inevitable attacks "
"of your old enemies and then go on to destroy them as punishment for their "
"warmongering past. Ultimate victory will be gained by the destruction of all "
"other kingdoms. "
msgstr ""
"Al final de \"La guerra per acabar amb totes les guerres durant una temporada"
"\", una banda de mercenaris sense feina vaga per uns camps devastats. Pren "
"el control d'aquesta banda, tria'n un rei i intenta restablir el regne "
"destruït pel qual havien lluitat. Has de sobreviure als atacs inevitables "
"dels teus antics enemics i després destruir-los com a càstig pel seu passat "
"bel·licista. La victòria definitiva s'obtindrà amb la destrucció de tots els "
"altres regnes. "

msgid ""
"At the present time your population is large and your income is great. The "
"difficulty is that your deposits of natural resources will soon be depleted. "
"The wealth and cohesiveness of your empire hinge on your ability to find new "
"sources of income to support your people's way of life. Overcome these "
"difficulties and lead your people into everlasting peace and prosperity by "
"making all enemy lands and subjects your own. "
msgstr ""
"Ara mateix tens una població gran i uns ingressos elevats. La dificultat és "
"que els teus jaciments de recursos naturals aviat s'esgotaran. La riquesa i "
"la cohesió del teu imperi depenen de la teva capacitat per trobar noves "
"fonts d'ingressos que sostinguin la manera de viure del teu poble. Supera "
"aquestes dificultats i condueix el teu poble cap a una pau i prosperitat "
"perdurables fent teves totes les terres i tots els súbdits enemics. "

msgid "Attempting to connect"
msgstr "Intentant connectar"

