"Fes clic ara en una de les dues opcions. Quan ho hagis fet, el teu grup "
"d'investigadors es posarà a treballar immediatament. "

msgid ""
"Click on the Bribe Tile. You will now see a pop-up of different monetary "
"amounts. Click on the amount you wish to offer to the enemy unit. If he "
"accepts the bribe, he will become yours and, like your first Spy, will "
"slowly increase his Skill Level. "
msgstr ""
"Fes clic a la casella de Suborn. Ara veuràs una finestra emergent amb "
"diferents quantitats de diners. Fes clic a la quantitat que vols oferir a la "
"unitat enemiga. Si accepta el suborn, passarà a ser teva i, com el teu "
"primer espia, augmentarà lentament el seu nivell d'habilitat. "

msgid ""
"Click on the Set Stop Button in the first row. Using the Camel & Arrow Icon, "
"now Click on the Mine. As you can see, your Caravan has begun to move "
"towards the Mine. "
msgstr ""
"Fes clic al botó Defineix parada de la primera fila. Amb la icona de camell "
"i fletxa, fes clic ara a la mina. Com pots veure, la caravana ha començat a "
"moure's cap a la mina. "

