msgid ""
"For a Kingdom separated by the sea from other Kingdoms and resources, sea-"
"borne trade will become important to your survival. "
msgstr ""
"Per a un regne separat pel mar d'altres regnes i recursos, el comerç marítim "
"esdevindrà important per a la supervivència. "

msgid ""
"For most of the Weapons projects, there are three possible levels to be "
"researched. Once the Mark I research of a Weapon has been completed, your "
"researchers will immediately begin work on the Mark II. "
msgstr ""
"Per a la majoria de projectes d'armes hi ha tres nivells possibles per "
"investigar. Quan s'hagi completat la recerca de marca I d'una arma, els "
"investigadors començaran immediatament a treballar en la marca II. "

msgid ""
"For the Seat of Power to be of use it must open its doors to the faithful, "
"so that they may gather in prayer and Invoke the Greater Being who helped "
"the people in ages past. "
msgstr ""
"Perquè el Tron de Poder sigui útil, ha d'obrir les portes als fidels perquè "
"s'hi reuneixin en pregària i invoquin l'ésser superior que va ajudar el "
"poble en temps passats. "

msgid "For trading purposes, you will need to Click on the Goods Button. "
msgstr "Per comerciar, hauràs de fer clic al botó de Béns. "

msgid ""
"For your second or third stops you will need to Click on other Harbors. When "
"you do, lists of goods you can pick up will appear. "
msgstr ""
"Per a la segona o tercera parada hauràs de fer clic en altres ports. Quan ho "
"facis, apareixeran llistes de béns que pots recollir. "

msgid "Foreign Worker Salaries"
msgstr "Sous dels treballadors estrangers"

msgid "Fort"
