msgid ""
"If a Kingdom has rejected your proposal, you can try another Kingdom, try "
"the same Kingdom again later, or else harbor a grudge and make them pay for "
"their insult at another time. You may make the same proposal to other "
"Kingdoms until one of them accepts. "
msgstr ""
"Si un regne ha rebutjat la proposta, pots provar-ho amb un altre regne, "
"tornar-ho a intentar amb el mateix més endavant o guardar rancor i fer-los "
"pagar l'insult en un altre moment. Pots fer la mateixa proposta a altres "
"regnes fins que un l'accepti. "

msgid ""
"If a lesser Kingdom has accepted your proposal, you can then pick up goods "
"from their Markets, and they can also pick up goods from yours. "
msgstr ""
"Si un regne menor ha acceptat la teva proposta, podràs recollir béns dels "
"seus mercats i ells també podran recollir béns dels teus. "

msgid ""
"If a second Harbor is your own, your Ship will drop off the goods, if any, "
"that you picked up from the first Harbor. "
msgstr ""
"Si el segon port és teu, el vaixell hi deixarà els béns, si n'hi ha, que "
"hagi recollit al primer port. "

msgid ""
"If his Skill Level reaches 90, your Spy will gain access to Espionage "
"information; he can then discover who the enemy's Spies are, and where they "
"are located. "
msgstr ""
"Si el seu nivell d'habilitat arriba a 90, l'espia tindrà accés a informació "
"d'espionatge; aleshores podrà descobrir qui són els espies enemics i on es "
"troben. "

msgid ""
"If left alone, these Fryhtans will seldom attack you; if you disturb them, "
"however, they will sally forth and attack without mercy. "
msgstr ""
"Si els deixes tranquils, aquests Fryhtans rarament t'atacaran; si els "
"molestes, però, sortiran a l'atac sense pietat. "

msgid ""
"If the Building is full of workers, it will be impossible to infiltrate; "
"with a Spy already settled in an enemy Village, however, there's a chance "
"the Spy will be hired for work in a Building. You will, however, have no "
"control over which Building the Spy is sent to work in. "
msgstr ""
"Si l'edifici és ple de treballadors, serà impossible infiltrar-s'hi; però si "
"ja tens un espia establert en un poble enemic, hi ha la possibilitat que el "
"contractin per treballar en un edifici. Tanmateix, no tindràs control sobre "
"a quin edifici l'enviaran a treballar. "

msgid ""
"If the Resistance is no longer decreasing, but is not yet 0, you may lower "
"it further by Clicking on the Grant Tile. When you do so, the Village's "
"resistance will decrease by around 10 points. This can be very expensive, "
"especially if the village has a large population, so don't do it until the "
"Resistance level is already quite low. "
msgstr ""
"Si la resistència ja no baixa però encara no és 0, pots reduir-la més fent "
"clic a la casella de Subvenció. Quan ho facis, la resistència del poble "
"baixarà uns 10 punts. Això pot ser molt car, sobretot si el poble té molta "
"població, així que no ho facis fins que el nivell de resistència ja sigui "
"força baix. "

msgid ""
"If the loyalty level of one of your villages is too low and you wish to "
"increase it quickly, there are several things you can do. First, when the "
"village is selected, try Clicking the Grant Tile. This will distribute 10 "
"dollars to each villager and increase his loyalty by 10 points. "
msgstr ""
"Si el nivell de lleialtat d'un dels teus pobles és massa baix i vols "
"augmentar-lo ràpidament, pots fer diverses coses. Primer, amb el poble "
"seleccionat, prova de fer clic a la casella de Subvenció. Això distribuirà "
"10 dòlars a cada vilatà i n'augmentarà la lleialtat en 10 punts. "

msgid ""
"If the second Harbor belongs to another Kingdom, you won't be able to drop "
"off any goods. In foreign Harbors you will only be able to pick up goods "
"from Markets linked to them. "
msgstr ""
"Si el segon port pertany a un altre regne, no hi podràs deixar cap bé. Als "
"ports estrangers només podràs recollir béns dels mercats que hi estiguin "
"enllaçats. "

msgid ""
"If this is set to 'Yes', you will be able to target and attack the units and "
"structures of the selected kingdom. If it is set to 'No', you will not. "
msgstr ""
"Si això està definit com a 'Sí', podràs apuntar i atacar les unitats i "
"estructures del regne seleccionat. Si està definit com a 'No', no podràs. "

msgid ""
"If you Click on N, your Caravan will pick up Nothing. This is useful when "
"your route is between a Mine and a Factory, as described below. "
msgstr ""
"Si fas clic a N, la caravana no recollirà res. Això és útil quan la ruta és "
"entre una mina i una fàbrica, com es descriu més avall. "

msgid ""
"If you Click on the Sneak Tile it will change into the Surrender Tile. When "
"this Tile is active, the changing of a Spy's color will notify the Kingdom "
"of that color that a person from your Kingdom has betrayed you and joined "
"them. "
msgstr ""
"Si fas clic a la casella d'Infiltrar-se, canviarà a la casella de Rendició. "
"Quan aquesta casella és activa, canviar el color d'un espia notificarà al "
"regne d'aquell color que una persona del teu regne t'ha traït i s'hi ha "
"unit. "

msgid ""
"If you are a bit confused with your routing and wish to see the location of "
"one of the stops you've set, Click on the View Stop Button.  When you do so, "
"your main screen will be centered over that stop. "
msgstr ""
"Si t'has embolicat una mica amb la ruta i vols veure la ubicació d'una de "
"les parades definides, fes clic al botó Mostra parada. Quan ho facis, la "
"pantalla principal se centrarà en aquella parada. "

msgid ""
"If you choose Bribe, your Spy will be asking an enemy unit to join him in "
"his spying activities. If the enemy refuses the bribe, your Spy will be "
"exposed and executed. "
msgstr ""
"Si tries Subornar, l'espia demanarà a una unitat enemiga que s'uneixi a les "
"seves activitats d'espionatge. Si l'enemic rebutja el suborn, l'espia serà "
"descobert i executat. "

msgid ""
"If you choose Sabotage, the Spy will do his best to slow production in the "
"Building. In a Mine he will slow the extraction of Raw Material, in a "
"Factory or War Factory he will slow the production of Goods and Weapons, and "
"in a Tower of Science he will slow Research. "
msgstr ""
"Si tries Sabotatge, l'espia farà tot el possible per alentir la producció de "
"l'edifici. En una mina alentirà l'extracció de matèria primera; en una "
"fàbrica o fàbrica de guerra alentirà la producció de béns i armes; i en una "
"Torre de la Ciència alentirà la recerca. "

msgid ""
"If you choose to hire a particular Mercenary, Click on his image and then "
"Click on the Hire tile. When you do, the Mercenary will exit the Inn and "
"wait for your further commands. "
msgstr ""
"Si decideixes contractar un mercenari concret, fes clic a la seva imatge i "
"després a la casella Contracta. Quan ho facis, el mercenari sortirà de la "
"fonda i esperarà les teves ordres. "

msgid ""
"If you go to war against a Kingdom you've established a trade treaty with, "
"the treaty will automatically be terminated. You may also terminate a trade "
"treaty at any time by Clicking on the \"Terminate our trade treaty\" option "
"under the Kingdoms Scroll /Diplomacy Button. "
msgstr ""
"Si entres en guerra contra un regne amb el qual has establert un tractat "
"comercial, el tractat es cancel·larà automàticament. També pots cancel·lar "
"un tractat comercial en qualsevol moment fent clic a l'opció «Cancel·la el "
"nostre tractat comercial» dins del pergamí de Regnes / botó Diplomàcia. "

msgid ""
"If you have a fort staffed with a General or King and linked to an "
"independent village, you may grant money to these villagers as well. In this "
"case a grant will cost you 30 dollars for each villager. This is one way to "
"lower an independent village's resistance to 0, but it is costly and risky. "
msgstr ""
"Si tens un fort ocupat per un general o pel rei i enllaçat amb un poble "
"independent, també pots concedir diners a aquests vilatans. En aquest cas, "
"la subvenció et costarà 30 dòlars per vilatà. És una manera de reduir la "
"resistència d'un poble independent a 0, però és cara i arriscada. "

msgid ""
"If you have an Independent Village selected, press the left or right arrow "
"key on your keyboard. This will cycle you through all of the Independent "
"Villages in the world. "
msgstr ""
"Si tens seleccionat un poble independent, prem la tecla de fletxa esquerra o "
"dreta del teclat. Això et farà passar per tots els pobles independents del "
"món. "

msgid ""
"If you have done your research, you'll also have Caravels and Galleons at "
"your disposal. These two Ships are built in the same way you build your "
"Transport. "
msgstr ""
"Si has fet la recerca necessària, també tindràs caravel·les i galeons a la "
"teva disposició. Aquests dos vaixells es construeixen de la mateixa manera "
"que el transport. "

msgid ""
"If you have established a trade treaty with another Kingdom, you can then "
"pick up any goods you want from their Markets. "
msgstr ""
"Si has establert un tractat comercial amb un altre regne, podràs recollir "
"qualsevol bé que vulguis dels seus mercats. "

msgid ""
"If you have found an ideal Village, one of your nationality and one "
"relatively close to you, then you may begin the process of absorbing it. "
msgstr ""
"Si has trobat un poble ideal, de la teva nacionalitat i relativament proper, "
"pots començar el procés d'absorbir-lo. "

msgid ""
"If you have no General with high leadership ability, then it is best to use "
"your King. Whichever you use, send him into the new Fort. If you do use your "
"King, be sure to send with him an escort of well-trained troops. "
msgstr ""
"Si no tens cap general amb una gran capacitat de lideratge, és millor fer "
"servir el teu rei. Sigui qui sigui, envia'l al nou fort. Si fas servir el "
"rei, assegura't d'enviar-hi també una escorta de tropes ben entrenades. "

msgid ""
"If you have selected a Caravel or a Galleon, you will have two choices of "
"what to view inside the Ship: Goods or Units. "
msgstr ""
"Si has seleccionat una caravel·la o un galeó, tindràs dues opcions per veure "
"què hi ha dins del vaixell: béns o unitats. "

msgid ""
"If you have trained more than one Manufacturer, send them quickly into the "
"Factory before the Peasants take up all the existing places. "
msgstr ""
"Si has entrenat més d'un fabricant, envia'ls ràpidament a la fàbrica abans "
"que els pagesos ocupin tots els llocs disponibles. "

msgid ""
"If you later build a Factory out of Linking distance from a Mine, you will "
"have to adjust your Factory's production manually by Clicking on the Change "
"Production Tile. "
msgstr ""
"Si més endavant construeixes una fàbrica fora de la distància d'enllaç d'una "
"mina, hauràs d'ajustar-ne la producció manualment fent clic a la casella de "
"Canviar producció. "

msgid ""
"If you later lose some of your Village population, you will not lose the "
"Caravans you already hired. "
msgstr ""
"Si més endavant perds part de la població del poble, no perdràs les "
"caravanes que ja has contractat. "

msgid ""
"If you now Click on the Market, you will see information on how much money "
"is flowing into your treasury. "
msgstr ""
"Si ara fas clic al mercat, veuràs informació sobre quants diners entren al "
"teu tresor. "

msgid ""
"If you run out of money, you won't be able to pay your troops.  This is a "
"big mistake.  If their loyalty falls to 30 or lower, they may change their "
"colors and march off to ally with another Kingdom. "
msgstr ""
"Si et quedes sense diners, no podràs pagar les tropes. Això és un gran "
"error. Si la seva lleialtat cau a 30 o menys, poden canviar de bàndol i "
"marxar per aliar-se amb un altre regne. "

msgid ""
"If you want to choose yourself, Click on the goods you wish to export. Your "
"Caravan will pick up the selected goods from your Market and then drop them "
"off at your Second Stop. "
msgstr ""
"Si ho vols triar tu mateix, fes clic als béns que vols exportar. La caravana "
"recollirà els béns seleccionats del teu mercat i els deixarà a la segona "
"parada. "

msgid ""
"If you want to reply to this message, Click on the colored square next to "
"it. This will take you to the Kingdoms Scroll page, where you can Click on "
"either Accept or Reject. "
msgstr ""
"Si vols respondre aquest missatge, fes clic al quadrat de color que hi ha al "
"costat. Això et portarà a la pàgina del pergamí de Regnes, on podràs fer "
"clic a Accepta o Rebutja. "

msgid ""
"If you want to sell your goods to a foreign Kingdom, you can do two things: "
"either wait for their Caravans to come to your Markets and pick up the goods "
"that you have for sale; "
msgstr ""
"Si vols vendre els teus béns a un regne estranger, pots fer dues coses: "
"esperar que les seves caravanes vinguin als teus mercats i recullin els béns "
"que tens a la venda; "

msgid ""
"If you wish to clear a stop from one of the stops you've chosen, Click on "
"the X Button for that stop. The stop will be cleared, and ready for you to "
"set to another stop. You may, alternately, set a new stop on top of the old "
"one.  The old one will be replaced with the new. "
msgstr ""
"Si vols esborrar una de les parades que has triat, fes clic al botó X "
"d'aquella parada. La parada quedarà buida i a punt perquè n'hi defineixis "
"una altra. També pots establir una parada nova damunt de l'antiga; l'antiga "
"serà substituïda per la nova. "

msgid ""
"If you wish to collect tax from all your Villages in the same way, Right-"
"Click on this number instead of Clicking on it. You will then collect tax "
"from all of your present and future Villages whenever their Loyalty Level "
"reaches this number.   "
msgstr ""
"Si vols recaptar impostos de tots els teus pobles de la mateixa manera, fes "
"clic dret en aquest número en lloc de fer-hi clic normal. Aleshores "
"recaptaràs impostos de tots els teus pobles presents i futurs sempre que el "
"seu nivell de lleialtat arribi a aquest número. "

msgid ""
"If you wish to review a lesson from within any game, Click on the Menu "
"Button at the top right of your screen and then Click on the Training "
"Button.  Then select the lesson you want to review.  When you Click on the "
"Start Button, the lesson will be overlaid on your present game.   "
msgstr ""
"Si vols revisar una lliçó des de qualsevol partida, fes clic al botó de menú "
"de la part superior dreta de la pantalla i després al botó d'entrenament. "
"Tot seguit selecciona la lliçó que vols revisar. Quan facis clic al botó "
"Inicia, la lliçó se sobreposarà a la partida actual. "

msgid ""
"If you wish to select a single soldier, you should Click, and not Right-"
"Click on him. You may then direct him anywhere by himself. He will still "
"remain a member of that Troop, unless he is sent into a Fort. "
msgstr ""
"Si vols seleccionar un sol soldat, hi has de fer clic normal, no clic dret. "
"Aleshores el podràs dirigir sol a qualsevol lloc. Continuarà sent membre "
"d'aquesta tropa, tret que l'enviïs a un fort. "

msgid ""
"If you wish to steal Information, Click on the Steal Information Tile. You "
"will be presented with a list of subjects; they're the same as the subjects "
"beneath the Scrolls on the top of your screen. "
msgstr ""
"Si vols robar informació, fes clic a la casella de Robar informació. Se't "
"presentarà una llista de temes; són els mateixos que hi ha sota els "
"pergamins de la part superior de la pantalla. "

msgid ""
"If you wish to unload a single unit, first move the Transport onto the shore "
"and then Right-Click on the picture of the unit you wish to disembark. That "
"unit will then exit the Transport and stand on the shore. "
msgstr ""
"Si vols descarregar una sola unitat, primer mou el transport fins a la riba "
"i després fes clic dret a la imatge de la unitat que vols desembarcar. "
"Aquesta unitat sortirà del transport i quedarà a la riba. "

msgid ""
"If you wish your Spy to evacuate an infiltrated area you must first select "
"the Building or Village where he resides, Click on the Spy Tile, select your "
"Spy and then Click on the Evacuate Tile option.  "
msgstr ""
"Si vols que l'espia evacui una zona infiltrada, primer has de seleccionar "
"l'edifici o poble on resideix, fer clic a la casella d'Espia, seleccionar "
"l'espia i després fer clic a l'opció d'Evacuar. "

msgid ""
"If your Spy or Spies are the only residents of an Enemy's Building, you will "
"have the option of Capturing the Building. While the Building is selected, "
"Clicking the Capture Tile will make it yours. If your Spy is a General in an "
"enemy Fort, you may capture it even if there are loyal enemy units still in "
"the Fort. "
msgstr ""
"Si el teu espia o espies són els únics residents d'un edifici enemic, "
"tindràs l'opció de capturar-lo. Amb l'edifici seleccionat, fer clic a la "
"casella de Captura el farà teu. Si el teu espia és un general en un fort "
"enemic, el pots capturar encara que hi quedin unitats enemigues lleials. "

msgid "Impassable Isthmus"
msgstr "Istme infranquejable"

msgid "Imports"
msgstr "Importacions"

msgid "In Fort"
msgstr "Al fort"

msgid "In Seat"
msgstr "Al Tron"

msgid ""
"In a Village a Spy will have but two choices: Sleeping or Sowing Dissent. "
"The default task is Sleeping. To toggle from Sleeping to Sowing Dissent, "
"Click the Tile again. "
msgstr ""
"En un poble, un espia només tindrà dues opcions: Dormir o Sembrar discòrdia. "
"La tasca per defecte és Dormir. Per alternar de Dormir a Sembrar discòrdia, "
"fes clic de nou a la casella. "

msgid ""
"In order to set a sea-trading route, there must be at least one Harbor. The "
"other Harbor required in a trading route can belong either to your Kingdom, "
"or to another Kingdom with which you have a trade treaty. "
msgstr ""
"Per establir una ruta de comerç marítim, cal que hi hagi almenys un port. "
"L'altre port necessari en una ruta comercial pot pertànyer al teu regne o a "
"un altre regne amb el qual tinguis un tractat comercial. "

msgid ""
"In some cases, even when you are not cut off by water, sea-borne Trade along "
"a coastline may be much faster than trade by Caravan. "
msgstr ""
"En alguns casos, fins i tot quan no estàs aïllat per l'aigua, el comerç "
"marítim al llarg de la costa pot ser molt més ràpid que el comerç amb "
"caravana. "

msgid ""
"In these training lessons for Seven Kingdoms we will cover every major "
"aspect of the game. To go to the next or previous page of a lesson, you may "
"either Click on the Arrow Buttons on your screen or you may press the \"<\" "
"and \">\" keys on your keyboard. Every lesson will begin with the game "
"running at the speed of 3. Press higher numbers on your keyboard to make "
"things move faster, or press lower numbers to slow things down.  Pressing 0 "
"will pause the game. "
msgstr ""
"En aquestes lliçons d'entrenament de Seven Kingdoms cobrirem tots els "
"aspectes principals del joc. Per anar a la pàgina següent o anterior d'una "
"lliçó, pots fer clic als botons de fletxa de la pantalla o prémer les tecles "
"\"<\" i \">\" del teclat. Cada lliçó començarà amb el joc funcionant a "
"velocitat 3. Prem números més alts al teclat perquè tot vagi més de pressa, "
"o números més baixos per alentir-ho. Prémer 0 posarà el joc en pausa. "

msgid ""
"In this first lesson you will learn how to recruit a group of Peasants and "
"then train them as a Troop of Soldiers. You will learn how to Sortie your "
"Troop from your Fort and how to quickly select and control it in the field. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta primera lliçó aprendràs a reclutar un grup de pagesos i després "
"entrenar-los com a tropa de soldats. Aprendràs a fer sortir la tropa del "
"fort i a seleccionar-la i controlar-la ràpidament al camp de batalla. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you learn how to build a Harbor and use it to construct "
"Ships. You will learn how to load them with troops, how to move them and "
"then how to disembark the troops. You will also learn the benefits of on-"
"board Leadership and how it can enhance your fighting ability. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a construir un port i a fer-lo servir per "
"construir vaixells. Aprendràs a carregar-hi tropes, a moure'ls i després a "
"desembarcar les tropes. També aprendràs els beneficis del lideratge a bord i "
"com pot millorar la teva capacitat de combat. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you learn how to use your Ships for trading with distant "
"Kingdoms, or for linking the distant parts of your empire. You will also "
"learn how to set ports of call, and how to manage cargo for your Ships, as "
"well as how to switch between Automatic Trading mode and Control mode. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a fer servir els teus vaixells per comerciar amb "
"regnes llunyans o per enllaçar parts allunyades del teu imperi. També "
"aprendràs a definir ports d'escala, a gestionar la càrrega dels vaixells i a "
"alternar entre el mode de comerç automàtic i el mode de control. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn How to Best Make Use of Scrolls of Power, and "
"How to Construct and Use Seats of Power. After learning about Seats of "
"Power, you will learn How to Usher In the Faithful, and how to make use of "
"their powers of prayer to invoke Greater Beings.  "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs com aprofitar millor els Pergamins de Poder i com "
"construir i fer servir Trons de Poder. Després d'aprendre'n el funcionament, "
"aprendràs com acollir els fidels i com utilitzar el poder de les seves "
"pregàries per invocar éssers superiors. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to build a Tower of Science and then use "
"it to conduct research into advanced Weaponry and Ships. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a construir una Torre de la Ciència i després a "
"fer-la servir per investigar armament i vaixells avançats. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to build an Inn, how to use it to attract "
"Mercenaries from the world over. You will also learn how to evaluate their "
"skills and then how to hire them to work for your Kingdom. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a construir una fonda i a fer-la servir per "
"atreure mercenaris d'arreu del món. També aprendràs a avaluar-ne les "
"habilitats i a contractar-los perquè treballin per al teu regne. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to capture both Independent and enemy "
"Villages. When you finish, you will know how to bring large numbers of "
"people into your Empire quickly. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a capturar pobles independents i enemics. Quan "
"acabis, sabràs com incorporar ràpidament grans quantitats de persones al teu "
"imperi. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to find Natural Resources and then how to "
"build a Mine to exploit them. You will also learn how to build a Factory and "
"a Market and how to make use of Links between your Buildings and Villages. "
"Finally, you will learn how to collect taxes from your people effectively. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a trobar recursos naturals i a construir una mina "
"per explotar-los. També aprendràs a construir una fàbrica i un mercat, i a "
"fer servir els enllaços entre els teus edificis i pobles. Finalment, "
"aprendràs a recaptar impostos del teu poble de manera eficaç. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to locate the Lairs of the Fryhtans and "
"the reasons why it can be highly rewarding to attack and defeat them. You "
"will also learn how to recover their hoarded treasures, including the long-"
"lost Scrolls of Power. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a localitzar els caus dels Fryhtans i per què pot "
"ser molt profitós atacar-los i derrotar-los. També aprendràs a recuperar els "
"tresors que han acumulat, inclosos els Pergamins de Poder perduts fa molt de "
"temps. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn how to train or hire Spies, how to infiltrate "
"the ranks of the enemy and how to use Spies to bribe, sabotage, capture and "
"steal. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a entrenar o contractar espies, a infiltrar-te a "
"les files de l'enemic i a fer servir espies per subornar, sabotejar, "
"capturar i robar. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn of the many things you can do to insure the "
"loyalty of your people. We will also cover how to avoid gaining the "
"reputation of a tyrant, and how to project the image of being a true and "
"noble King. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs moltes de les coses que pots fer per assegurar la "
"lleialtat del teu poble. També veurem com evitar guanyar-te reputació de "
"tirà i com projectar la imatge d'un rei veritable i noble. "

msgid ""
"In this lesson you will learn to make use of your Weapons Research by the "
"building of War Factories and the production of Weapons. You will also learn "
"how to control those Weapons in the field, and how to maximize their "
"effectiveness. Special attention will be given to the most unusual weapon, "
"the Porcupine. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó aprendràs a aprofitar la recerca d'armes construint "
"fàbriques de guerra i produint armes. També aprendràs a controlar aquestes "
"armes al camp de batalla i a maximitzar-ne l'eficàcia. Es dedicarà una "
"atenció especial a l'arma més inusual: el Porc espí. "

msgid ""
"In this scenario you will have 15 years in which to eradicate the world's "
"Fryhtans. If you tire of this noble task, you may instead turn your sword on "
"the world's human kingdoms. Destroying them will also result in victory for "
"you. "
msgstr ""
"En aquest escenari tindràs 15 anys per eradicar els Fryhtans del món. Si et "
"canses d'aquesta noble tasca, pots girar l'espasa contra els regnes humans "
"del món. Destruir-los també et donarà la victòria. "

msgid ""
"In this training lesson, you will be instructed in the most basic methods of "
"building a prosperous Kingdom and keeping it safe from those who would take "
"it from you. "
msgstr ""
"En aquesta lliçó d'entrenament aprendràs els mètodes més bàsics per "
"construir un regne pròsper i mantenir-lo fora de perill dels qui te'l "
"voldrien prendre. "

