msgstr "Rei normand"

msgid "Not all those who Wander are Lost"
msgstr "No tots els qui vaguen estan perduts"

msgid ""
"Note that in the window on the lower right, the First Stop of your Caravan "
"has been set by default to the market where the Caravan was hired. You will "
"want to set the Second Stop as a Market in a foreign Kingdom. "
msgstr ""
"Fixa't que, a la finestra inferior dreta, la primera parada de la caravana "
"s'ha establert per defecte al mercat on l'has contractada. Voldràs establir "
"la segona parada com un mercat d'un regne estranger. "

msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Res"

msgid ""
"Notice that if you click the Grant Tile repeatedly, the amount of increase "
"in loyalty will reduce; the people are beginning to take the extra money for "
"granted. It is therefore best to wait a while after you Grant money to a "
"village before you do it again. "
msgstr ""
"Tingues en compte que, si fas clic repetidament a la casella de Subvenció, "
"l'augment de lleialtat es reduirà; la gent començarà a donar per fet aquests "
"diners extra. Per tant, és millor esperar una mica després de concedir "
"diners a un poble abans de tornar-ho a fer. "

msgid "Notification Currently Disabled. Click to Enable."
msgstr "Notificació desactivada. Fes clic per activar-la."

msgid "Notification Currently Enabled. Click to Disable."
msgstr "Notificació activada. Fes clic per desactivar-la."

msgid ""
"Now it's time to learn a fast and easy way to select an entire group. To "
"illustrate, first Click on the Fort or the Village (anything to de-select "
"the Troops). "
msgstr ""
"Ara és hora d'aprendre una manera ràpida i fàcil de seleccionar tot un grup. "
"Per veure-ho, primer fes clic al fort o al poble, qualsevol cosa que "
"desseleccioni les tropes. "

msgid "Now select the Caravan you've hired. "
msgstr "Ara selecciona la caravana que has contractat. "

msgid ""
"Now that the Troops are no longer selected, Right-Click on any Soldier of "
"your Troop. "
msgstr ""
"Ara que les tropes ja no estan seleccionades, fes clic dret en qualsevol "
"soldat de la tropa. "

msgid ""
"Now that the eight Peasants have been selected, order them into the Fort to "
"begin their training. Right-Click your crooked Golden Arrow Cursor on the "
"Fort. "
msgstr ""
"Ara que has seleccionat els vuit pagesos, ordena'ls que entrin al fort per "
"començar l'entrenament. Fes clic dret amb el cursor de fletxa daurada corba "
"sobre el fort. "

msgid ""
"Now you should return the Troop to the Fort for continued training. Do this "
"by Clicking on the Withdraw Tile.  If your Fort has been destroyed, this "
"Tile will not be available. "
msgstr ""
"Ara hauries de retornar la tropa al fort perquè continuï entrenant-se. Fes-"
"ho clicant a la casella de Retirada. Si el fort ha estat destruït, aquesta "
"casella no estarà disponible. "

msgid ""
"Now you will see a list of items you can pick up from that Harbor. The items "
"available will depend upon what the Harbor is linked to. You may also choose "
"not to pick up anything. "
msgstr ""
"Ara veuràs una llista d'articles que pots recollir d'aquest port. Els "
"articles disponibles dependran d'allò amb què el port estigui enllaçat. "
"També pots triar no recollir res. "

msgid ""
"Now you will see that, as with your Caravans, you can set three different "
"stops for your Trading Ships. "
msgstr ""
"Ara veuràs que, igual que amb les caravanes, pots definir tres parades "
"diferents per als vaixells mercants. "

msgid ""
"Now, instead of Clicking on the name of a single Weapon, Click on the number "
"to the right of a Weapon or Weapons until the number you wish to build is "
"displayed. When you are finished, Click on the Done Button. "
msgstr ""
"Ara, en lloc de fer clic al nom d'una sola arma, fes clic al número de la "
"dreta d'una o més armes fins que es mostri la quantitat que vols construir. "
"Quan hagis acabat, fes clic al botó Fet. "

msgid ""
"Now, with a Cannon, Catapult, Spitfire or flaming arrow (Egyptian), target "
"and attack a Porcupine. To do so, first select any other weapon. Then, while "
"holding down the Shift key on your keyboard, Click the Green Hand Cursor on "
"a Porcupine. "
msgstr ""
"Ara, amb un Canó, una Catapulta, un Llançaflames o una fletxa encesa "
"(egípcia), apunta i ataca un Porc espí. Per fer-ho, selecciona primer "
"qualsevol altra arma. Després, mentre mantens premuda la tecla Maj del "
"teclat, fes clic amb el cursor de mà verd sobre un Porc espí. "

msgid "Offer %s"
msgstr "Oferir %s"

msgid "Offer Bribe"
msgstr "Oferir suborn"

msgid "Offer aid."
msgstr "Ofereix ajut."

msgid "Offer to pay tribute."
msgstr "Ofereix pagar tribut."

msgid "Offer to purchase throne and unite kingdoms."
msgstr "Ofereix comprar el tron i unir els regnes."

msgid "Offer to transfer technology."
msgstr "Ofereix transferir tecnologia."

