msgid ""
"Train a Miner by first Clicking on your Village and then Clicking on the "
"Train Tile. "
msgstr ""
"Entrena un miner fent clic primer al teu poble i després a la casella "
"d'Entrenar. "

msgid "Training Units"
msgstr "Entrenament d'unitats"

msgid "Transparent report mode"
msgstr "Mode d'informe transparent"

msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Transport"

msgid ""
"Transports are for transporting Soldiers or Weapons; let's look next at how "
"to load them. "
msgstr ""
"Els transports serveixen per transportar soldats o armes; ara veurem com "
"carregar-los. "

msgid "Tread Carefully"
msgstr "Ves amb compte"

msgid "Treasure"
