msgid ""
"Your King is surrounded and fighting for his life. If he is slain you will "
"have to choose the successor to his throne. You choices are two good leaders "
"of minority factions or a weak leader of the majority. Choose well, for your "
"survival will depend upon it. Victory will be achieved when your kingdom "
"stands alone.  "
msgstr ""
"El teu rei està envoltat i lluita per la seva vida. Si cau mort, hauràs de "
"triar el successor del seu tron. Les opcions són dos bons líders de faccions "
"minoritàries o un líder feble de la majoria. Tria bé, perquè la teva "
"supervivència en dependrà. Aconseguiràs la victòria quan el teu regne quedi "
"sol. "

